if {Bartholomew.2bSpoken} == true:
	jump Bartholomew3a6/
else:
	# Player approaches with the front door and uses a “knock” interaction.
	Bartholomew: Good day, sir. What is your business?
	Devin: I come in response to a summons in a letter from the Lord of this manor, Arthur Sharp. He requested an audience.
	Bartholomew: I see. Do come in, sir. I’ll enquire with Lord Sharp.
	Devin: Gramercy.
	# Transition into the grand hallway of the manor house.
	Bartholomew: You may await Lord Sharp where you stand, hunter. He will greet you here.
	Devin: Of course. I will take a moment to observe the surroundings whilst I wait.
	Bartholomew: Observe your surroundings, if you must. But pray, neither damage nor remove owt. This house has suffered enough.
	Devin: Indeed.
	# The Sharp Butler exits, leaving Devin alone in the grand hallway.
	set {Bartholomew.2bSpoken} = true
